cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the exact LoColemotion commit and the evidence records used. SDK1 completion is a bounded milestone result."
type: software
title: "LoColemotion: portable locomotion and a fail-closed experiment harness"
authors:
  - family-names: Chambers
    given-names: Charles
repository-code: "https://github.com/Slagathore/LoColemotion"
url: "https://github.com/Slagathore/LoColemotion"
abstract: >-
  Portable locomotion across Godot/Jolt, Rapier/Parry and MuJoCo, with prospective
  experimental qualification, separate authorization, retained outcomes and
  evidence-gated claims. SDK1 covers twenty bounded milestones and does not
  establish formal cross-engine equivalence.
keywords:
  - locomotion
  - physics simulation
  - experimental provenance
  - reproducible research
